sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant ReceiverScreen
    participant RsaKeyManagerScreen
    participant SenderScreen
    participant BiometricHelper
    participant LocalAuth as local_auth<br/>(LocalAuthentication)

    Note over User,LocalAuth: No app-launch biometric gate exists.<br/>BiometricHelper.authenticate() is used per-action at 3 sites.

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over User,RsaKeyManagerScreen: Site 1 - RSA Key Vault entry guard
    User->>ReceiverScreen: tap gear icon -> _openKeyManager()
    ReceiverScreen->>BiometricHelper: authenticate("Access RSA Key Manager")
    alt success
        BiometricHelper-->>ReceiverScreen: true
        ReceiverScreen->>RsaKeyManagerScreen: push(RsaKeyManagerScreen)
    else fail
        BiometricHelper-->>ReceiverScreen: false
        ReceiverScreen-->>User: stay on ReceiverScreen, no navigation
    end
    end

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over RsaKeyManagerScreen,LocalAuth: Site 2 - re-gate within RsaKeyManagerScreen.initState()
    RsaKeyManagerScreen->>RsaKeyManagerScreen: addPostFrameCallback(_authenticate)
    RsaKeyManagerScreen->>BiometricHelper: authenticate("Unlock RSA Key Vault")
    alt fail
        BiometricHelper-->>RsaKeyManagerScreen: false
        RsaKeyManagerScreen->>RsaKeyManagerScreen: Navigator.pop(context) - vault closes immediately
    else success
        BiometricHelper-->>RsaKeyManagerScreen: true
        RsaKeyManagerScreen->>RsaKeyManagerScreen: _gateChecked=true -> render vault UI<br/>+ updateLastVaultAccess(uid)
    end
    end

    rect rgb(247,247,247)
    Note over SenderScreen,LocalAuth: Site 3 - Sender AES key encryption (Step 3, see SD007)
    SenderScreen->>BiometricHelper: authenticate("Authenticate to encrypt<br/>the AES key for {username}")
    alt fail
        BiometricHelper-->>SenderScreen: false
        loop user may retry indefinitely
            SenderScreen-->>User: "Authentication failed or was cancelled. Tap to retry."
        end
    end
    end

    rect rgb(255,255,255)
    Note over BiometricHelper,LocalAuth: BiometricHelper.authenticate(reason) internals
    BiometricHelper->>LocalAuth: canCheckBiometrics
    alt no biometric hardware (e.g. emulator)
        LocalAuth-->>BiometricHelper: false
        BiometricHelper-->>BiometricHelper: return true (pass-through, no gate)
    else hardware available
        LocalAuth-->>BiometricHelper: true
        BiometricHelper->>LocalAuth: authenticate(localizedReason: reason,<br/>biometricOnly:false, persistAcrossBackgrounding:true)
        LocalAuth-->>BiometricHelper: true / false (any exception -> false)
    end
    end

    Note over RsaKeyManagerScreen: Redundant 2nd "Confirm: Regenerate RSA Keys"<br/>biometric prompt was deliberately removed -<br/>only the vault-entry gate remains for<br/>regenerate/delete (backed by non-biometric<br/>_showConfirmDialog() bottom sheet)
